%% Failed loadDocument sequence
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber

  actor Caller as Application code
  participant API as CanvasEditPort
  participant Runtime as RuntimeRoot
  participant Stager as Staged load boundary
  participant Diagnostics as DiagnosticsHub
  participant Store as DocumentStoreKernel
  participant Interaction as InteractionEngine
  participant Projection as DocumentProjectionCache
  participant Spatial as SpatialKernel
  participant Resources as ResourceKernel
  participant Frame as FrameEngine
  participant Signals as Public signals

  Caller->>API: loadDocument(document)
  API->>Runtime: delegate loadDocument(document)
  Runtime->>Runtime: reject disposed runtime before mutation

  alt runtime is disposed
    Runtime--x API: throw StateError("CanvasRuntime is disposed.")
    API--x Caller: rethrow StateError
    Note over Runtime,Signals: Rejection is a boundary failure. No store, cache, repaint, action, or listener effect is started.
  else runtime accepts public entry
    Runtime->>Store: read current committed identity, selection, revisions, and id admission state
    Store-->>Runtime: current committed state remains installed

    Runtime->>Stager: validate public CanvasDocument
    Stager->>Stager: verify DTO invariants, limits, duplicate ids, resource references, and CanvasMetadata

    alt public document or frozen metadata validation fails
      Stager--x Runtime: validation failure
    else runtime materialization fails
      Runtime->>Stager: prepare full document replacement from DTO and current snapshot
      Stager->>Stager: materialize compact tables, resource descriptors, order, meta, and id generator floor
      Stager--x Runtime: materialization failure
    end

    Runtime->>Diagnostics: project load failure
    Diagnostics->>Diagnostics: sanitize path and bounded details
    Diagnostics-->>Runtime: CanvasDataException or StateError
    Runtime--x API: rethrow projected exception
    API--x Caller: rethrow projected exception

    Note over Runtime,Interaction: Active gesture is not interrupted. Preview, pending line, pointer normalization, and pending tap history remain unchanged.
    Note over Store: Committed document identity, selection, controllerEpoch, and all document revisions remain unchanged.
    Note over Projection,Frame: Projection, spatial, resource, paint, static, text, path, stroke, and overlay caches remain unchanged.
    Note over Frame,Signals: No main repaint, overlay repaint, CanvasActionCommitted event, text edit event, public notify, or revision listener publication occurs.
  end

  Note over Runtime,Store: Failure stops before PreparedDocumentLoad install. There is no atomic install, revision bump, cache invalidation action, or success-path interaction cleanup.
